 class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Starter\" title=\"Starter\">Starter</a>:</b> Starter equipment cannot be traded, sold or crafted.<br /><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Item_Starter_Breastplate.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Item_Starter_Breastplate.jpg/420px-Item_Starter_Breastplate.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"405\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Item_Starter_Breastplate.jpg 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>A breastplate covers your front and back. A light suit of studded leather beneath the breastplate protects your limbs without restricting movement much.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>This item is also a <a href=\"/page/Veteran_Award_Starter_Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Veteran Award Starter Items\">Veteran Award Starter Item</a> for certain race/class combinations.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816174923\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.077 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.114 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4413/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29129/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7629/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 34/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 26/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   97.190      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   97.190      1 -total\n 93.93%   91.289      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 77.55%   75.373     52 Template:IO\n 37.10%   36.054      5 Template:Popup\n 25.49%   24.771      